        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melon Bounce</strong> is a casual puzzle game where you drag and launch cute fruits at your desired angle and strength, merging matching fruits together.<br>Start with small cherries or blueberries and evolve into bigger fruits, with the ultimate goal of creating a sweet melon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will it really end with the melon…? A next stage awaits, only for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple Controls, Deep Strategy</strong><br>Adjust the angle and power with a single drag to launch fruits. Easy for anyone to pick up, but precise control is needed to aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍊 <strong>The Thrill of Merging</strong><br>When matching fruits collide, a new fruit is born! The step-by-step evolution keeps you coming back for more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😆 <strong>Lively Fruit Characters</strong><br>With diverse expressions and animations, these fruits feel less like objects and more like cute, living companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ <strong>Refreshing Beach Stage</strong><br>Enjoy charming visuals set against a seaside backdrop of sand and ocean waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Variety of Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Ice Mode</strong>: Sometimes fruits get frozen solid and won’t move. Use your wits to adapt to these unpredictable moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 <strong>Bomb Mode</strong>: Boom! A single explosion can turn the game around in an instant for thrilling tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 <strong>Mini Mode</strong>: Fruits shrink to bite-size, demanding precise control to slip through narrow gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚪ <strong>White Berry Mode</strong>: Only white fruits can be launched! Craft unique strategies with this special restriction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Climb the rankings by scoring high! Prove your skills and feel the thrill of seeing your name among the top players.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melon Bounce</strong> is a casual puzzle game where you drag and launch cute fruits at your desired angle and strength, merging matching fruits together.<br>Start with small cherries or blueberries and evolve into bigger fruits, with the ultimate goal of creating a sweet melon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will it really end with the melon…? A next stage awaits, only for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple Controls, Deep Strategy</strong><br>Adjust the angle and power with a single drag to launch fruits. Easy for anyone to pick up, but precise control is needed to aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍊 <strong>The Thrill of Merging</strong><br>When matching fruits collide, a new fruit is born! The step-by-step evolution keeps you coming back for more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😆 <strong>Lively Fruit Characters</strong><br>With diverse expressions and animations, these fruits feel less like objects and more like cute, living companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝️ <strong>Refreshing Beach Stage</strong><br>Enjoy charming visuals set against a seaside backdrop of sand and ocean waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Variety of Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Ice Mode</strong>: Sometimes fruits get frozen solid and won’t move. Use your wits to adapt to these unpredictable moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 <strong>Bomb Mode</strong>: Boom! A single explosion can turn the game around in an instant for thrilling tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 <strong>Mini Mode</strong>: Fruits shrink to bite-size, demanding precise control to slip through narrow gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚪ <strong>White Berry Mode</strong>: Only white fruits can be launched! Craft unique strategies with this special restriction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Climb the rankings by scoring high! Prove your skills and feel the thrill of seeing your name among the top players.</p>",
        "short_description": "Match the same fruits and 🍓➡️🍍 create a brand-new one! Challenge yourself to complete the 🍈 melon in an unpredictable physics puzzle!",
